{"app":"GET NOTES!","version":1,"handle":"magickmica","collected_at":"2026-11-11T16:18:33.419Z","since":"2026-11-04","partial":false,"count":79,"notes":[{"id":384620767,"date":"2026-11-11T15:00:13.656Z","text":"\"The universe placed an eye within you, not just to see—but to wake you up when you forget your power.\"","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5196546e-3da4-4838-b738-c9cd69bb2b6c_1483x989.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384620767"},{"id":384609852,"date":"2026-11-11T14:09:11.934Z","text":"💯 x 2","likes":9,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/20f091da-0a38-4a65-ad93-660894c774a3_356x357.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384609852"},{"id":384572888,"date":"2026-11-11T13:22:28.884Z","text":"✨","likes":7,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1a5ba331-5ef9-4dfe-8532-a62824db8f9a_720x720.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384572888"},{"id":384476606,"date":"2026-11-11T12:33:00.350Z","text":"✨","likes":5,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/76945c7c-2093-4748-9278-15a82808423a_1655x950.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384476606"},{"id":384527861,"date":"2026-11-11T12:17:02.147Z","text":"Every sunrise whispers, \"Let's make another impossible thing happen.\"","likes":5,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384527861"},{"id":384463016,"date":"2026-11-11T10:06:49.875Z","text":"Decisions are portals. Time is just waiting for you to choose a door.","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/df53f0d7-bedf-48b0-9cca-346d30c3e790_1360x768.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384463016"},{"id":384058275,"date":"2026-11-10T21:03:07.436Z","text":"Yes, make your own reality.","likes":28,"restacks":4,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7268e712-70b8-4cd1-86f1-e1bed02d2b1f_2048x2048.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384058275"},{"id":384020065,"date":"2026-11-10T19:48:20.771Z","text":"🟥🟪▀▄▀▄▀▄🟨🟧","likes":11,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/49adeeb9-cee4-4235-a2d2-8b4f8c9bdc54_1024x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-384020065"},{"id":383982628,"date":"2026-11-10T19:03:40.722Z","text":"A little light escaped.\n\nAn entire world followed.\n\n🏻‎🏼‎🏽‎🏾🏿","likes":13,"restacks":3,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0442e4f3-310a-4ff9-a4a5-a5c1887ec4b5_1200x2880.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383982628"},{"id":383804882,"date":"2026-11-10T15:40:23.392Z","text":"","likes":11,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3a9f23bb-7512-47e2-a500-0fe445f13540_1024x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383804882"},{"id":383704734,"date":"2026-11-10T13:43:42.491Z","text":"Something is glowing on the other side.\n\nAnd it doesn't appear to be following our rules.","likes":15,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9de8b697-3033-458c-b9d1-49e74acede5a_922x1152.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383704734"},{"id":383680691,"date":"2026-11-10T13:11:18.595Z","text":"Morning. I’m home.","likes":12,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/62c0e3cb-2f16-4d5b-ae19-30ab622c6795_1671x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383680691"},{"id":383275071,"date":"2026-11-10T00:00:00.408Z","text":"The signal is strange tonight.\n\nI think the stars are hacking the mainframe.","likes":27,"restacks":5,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b26b296b-97e9-4f87-9440-6fa7ce412a6f_720x720.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383275071"},{"id":383271551,"date":"2026-11-09T23:21:18.430Z","text":"You are not here merely to observe the cosmos. You are here to imagine what else it could become.","likes":9,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e31770f3-8d60-47c4-8b31-c83c3bd07576_1280x832.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383271551"},{"id":375761015,"date":"2026-11-09T23:12:37.427Z","text":"I sent a signal into the universe.\n\nSomething unexpected answered back.","likes":14,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9a94135c-9d0e-4c1e-a5ba-0b93ac15f619_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-375761015"},{"id":383183473,"date":"2026-11-09T21:12:58.263Z","text":"today’s mission: \n\nfind the strange, \n\nphotograph the beautiful,\n\n✗✗✗ and absolutely do not ask the Cheshire Cat for directions.","likes":22,"restacks":3,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/46a5f848-cd0d-442d-988c-27504287b37d_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383183473"},{"id":383049480,"date":"2026-11-09T20:33:00.795Z","text":"The rabbit tipped his hat and whispered, “Don't be late.”\n\nSome dreams are not destinations; they're rides you take.\n\nSo leave your map behind and let the moon decide, There are galaxies hiding on the other side. \n\nThe clock can melt, the stars can rearrange, \n\nThe strangest little doorways lead to worlds that change. \n\nDon't chase the dream or ask it where it's been, \n\nJust climb aboard and let the magic pull you in. \n\nThe rabbit smiled, “Now darling, trust the ride…”\n\n Sometimes the dream knows where you need to arrive.","likes":7,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/74e28a82-640e-42fc-a413-cd5cb067ba24_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383049480"},{"id":383145279,"date":"2026-11-09T20:24:50.573Z","text":"😃","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/177e571c-5e72-4b32-868d-e0ec4454d5e0_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-383145279"},{"id":382927683,"date":"2026-11-09T17:12:00.137Z","text":"100%","likes":19,"restacks":5,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aad6293b-f41a-4a0a-8db5-9bbfab0f21cf_2048x1152.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382927683"},{"id":382923548,"date":"2026-11-09T16:07:39.100Z","text":"⭕🟣⏺️","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382923548"},{"id":382787049,"date":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.312Z","text":"Flowers grew through the interference. \n\nLittle miracles in corrupted color.\n\nEven the broken things were learning how to bloom.","likes":14,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bf516924-7491-4dfe-ad55-fc3e394e3f41_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382787049"},{"id":381875594,"date":"2026-11-09T14:32:20.895Z","text":"https://substack.com/home/post/p-223659024","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/00db123f-33a7-4b6d-ba82-2024cb6f6c15_440x389.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381875594"},{"id":382780997,"date":"2026-11-09T14:00:24.489Z","text":"The future is a strange little creature. Feed it wonder.","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382780997"},{"id":382772035,"date":"2026-11-09T12:58:54.970Z","text":"Somewhere between two frames, a new universe began growing grass.\n\nNobody noticed.\n\nExcept the trees.","likes":13,"restacks":2,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/20bc8e19-63ed-4cf9-beb0-60111d72515f_1207x2112.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382772035"},{"id":382761572,"date":"2026-11-09T12:42:59.905Z","text":"You don't have to see the whole path. Just believe in the next little spark.","likes":7,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":"https://image.mux.com/m7BdGIhraJam6Z4BR43zIlkxQNk02g1qDY8OSwxDZqyo/thumbnail.jpg","video":"https://stream.mux.com/m7BdGIhraJam6Z4BR43zIlkxQNk02g1qDY8OSwxDZqyo.m3u8","link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382761572"},{"id":382729316,"date":"2026-11-09T12:00:00.422Z","text":"Currently accepting wishes, impossible dreams, and mildly suspicious moonbeams.","likes":11,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382729316"},{"id":382728798,"date":"2026-11-09T11:45:12.176Z","text":"Plant your wishes where the shadows grow. Some dreams need darkness before they bloom.","likes":11,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382728798"},{"id":382712563,"date":"2026-11-09T11:12:01.736Z","text":"\"Even the smallest moon carries enough magic to change an entire sky.\"","likes":18,"restacks":5,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/baf5b25c-1f65-4404-9c78-5ddc2d4510fd_1027x1531.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382712563"},{"id":382411933,"date":"2026-11-08T23:25:08.998Z","text":"I looked for the familiar stars.\n\n Found an entirely different universe.\n\nBeautiful mistake.","likes":29,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd4652c9-8e2c-47f4-a942-1ca5c16c1cc4_768x1344.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382411933"},{"id":382137122,"date":"2026-11-08T22:55:00.185Z","text":"","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":"https://image.mux.com/oNf100SzOyRwto7tcrJ7XsfdVYnPskDwOjoPF008CfPU00/thumbnail.jpg","video":"https://stream.mux.com/oNf100SzOyRwto7tcrJ7XsfdVYnPskDwOjoPF008CfPU00.m3u8","link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382137122"},{"id":382394127,"date":"2026-11-08T22:55:00.015Z","text":"❤️🧡💛💚💙💜 Take a seat….","likes":16,"restacks":5,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5626d2e8-5412-40a2-ad2a-3587c76b66b8_1536x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382394127"},{"id":382386202,"date":"2026-11-08T22:42:48.772Z","text":"Do not shrink your wonder to fit inside someone else's understanding.","likes":10,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382386202"},{"id":382312023,"date":"2026-11-08T21:00:03.196Z","text":"✨","likes":11,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/33b54756-8207-4ad3-9772-6a7f56372975_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382312023"},{"id":382144574,"date":"2026-11-08T17:10:31.169Z","text":"“Please wait…downloading ancestral wisdom.”","likes":12,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8d3b4efa-1c70-44e1-82a2-7a65f315a025_1200x847.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382144574"},{"id":382113140,"date":"2026-11-08T16:31:04.277Z","text":"✨","likes":5,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382113140"},{"id":382094928,"date":"2026-11-08T16:08:26.210Z","text":"","likes":17,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bbf11937-2294-4c14-a275-beb2a1ea07e8_1200x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-382094928"},{"id":381987594,"date":"2026-11-08T14:00:00.189Z","text":"My dreams have windows. Sometimes the universe stops by for tea.","likes":11,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381987594"},{"id":381984510,"date":"2026-11-08T13:36:54.517Z","text":"You know me, just reading in a sea of noise.","likes":6,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381984510"},{"id":381979068,"date":"2026-11-08T13:28:25.073Z","text":"Magick Mica Art made the list:  Create a GIF fast with Chat GTP.\n\nhttps://magickmicaart.substack.com/p/the-still-image-is-getting-restless","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381979068"},{"id":381977917,"date":"2026-11-08T13:26:35.258Z","text":"A year ago………","likes":5,"restacks":1,"replies":3,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381977917"},{"id":381889924,"date":"2026-11-08T10:28:02.353Z","text":"“I live somewhere between once upon a time and what if.”","likes":13,"restacks":3,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c6fac600-1419-4830-9111-462470ae931f_553x309.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381889924"},{"id":381886322,"date":"2026-11-08T10:19:09.858Z","text":"","likes":7,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381886322"},{"id":381875355,"date":"2026-11-08T09:50:23.102Z","text":"🍪Never too early for a cookie.","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381875355"},{"id":381874875,"date":"2026-11-08T09:49:11.096Z","text":"Become the alchemist of your attention. Whatever you illuminate begins to reveal its possibilities.","likes":8,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7c5cb0fa-ef74-4aff-9ae8-213db58069df_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381874875"},{"id":381660109,"date":"2026-11-08T00:39:24.702Z","text":"✨","likes":33,"restacks":8,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/22194258-7564-46b8-934f-bd9244e5384c_1254x1254.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381660109"},{"id":381629658,"date":"2026-11-07T23:39:48.365Z","text":"Every stitch connects a moment. Every moment makes a world.","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/880bdf66-5f72-46f2-8973-58f00b82ca1b_508x337.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381629658"},{"id":381622718,"date":"2026-11-07T23:26:43.850Z","text":"GIFS all the way.   Anyone can play. \n\nhttps://magickmicaart.substack.com/p/the-still-image-is-getting-restless","likes":10,"restacks":1,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a8bd8437-a778-4758-bb3b-bde1896cbf08_431x387.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381622718"},{"id":381417024,"date":"2026-11-07T18:21:51.421Z","text":"\"Darling, I wasn't born to follow the yellow brick road. I prefer Route 66.\"","likes":11,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7bfe06e2-e2ee-4351-97aa-f8a99aec14f5_1027x1531.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381417024"},{"id":381322920,"date":"2026-11-07T16:26:08.965Z","text":"A garden is never just a garden. Sometimes it's a conversation between the visible and invisible.","likes":11,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381322920"},{"id":381282735,"date":"2026-11-07T15:36:28.361Z","text":"The forest was never just a collection of trees. It was a library that didn't require electricity.","likes":25,"restacks":5,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a58775de-3d58-4a7e-b00b-54201ec7d613_1824x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381282735"},{"id":381168243,"date":"2026-11-07T13:02:02.074Z","text":"Vibes\n\n✨","likes":9,"restacks":3,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/647928e8-d31b-4906-a8a1-41bfb10cf36b_1535x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-381168243"},{"id":380954208,"date":"2026-11-07T04:10:14.236Z","text":"⋆˙⟡ ⋆🪄.˚ ⊹₊⟡ ⋆ 𓁹 𓁹","likes":12,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd74feef-1b52-473f-9979-fc23a2ce7483_1155x1154.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-380954208"},{"id":380020261,"date":"2026-11-06T14:00:25.881Z","text":"Life is a picnic. Bring your own magic.","likes":14,"restacks":4,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f5553bd1-aed5-4407-88ee-58a1d32791fa_1024x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-380020261"},{"id":380339563,"date":"2026-11-06T14:00:10.438Z","text":"\"A goddess doesn't need to know everything. She knows what deserves her attention.\"","likes":10,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/84e39bf8-4c31-474b-bf0c-87f32991fad2_1846x1200.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-380339563"},{"id":380306549,"date":"2026-11-06T13:02:19.923Z","text":"Every dream is a tiny rebellion against the belief that the present is all there is. 🌠","likes":12,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b568d785-a13c-41fc-9949-8287b5f89aea_1936x1088.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-380306549"},{"id":380256906,"date":"2026-11-06T11:41:58.978Z","text":"Know thyself. Question thy programming. Remain curious.","likes":19,"restacks":3,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-380256906"},{"id":379909091,"date":"2026-11-06T02:03:50.993Z","text":"","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a920afd6-48af-48ca-b14b-d92bc933c828_680x384.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379909091"},{"id":379991117,"date":"2026-11-06T01:41:00.693Z","text":"☁️","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379991117"},{"id":379952180,"date":"2026-11-06T00:32:33.616Z","text":"👑","likes":2,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7d569774-a3a3-43df-a181-f2f5a6d6d0a2_864x1152.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379952180"},{"id":379913392,"date":"2026-11-06T00:00:04.012Z","text":"\"I'm not saying I've gone soft… I'm saying I've upgraded my darkness to a holographic frequency of unconditional love.\"","likes":17,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/93048c55-2acb-4f15-b461-f6a7787805d7_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379913392"},{"id":379903682,"date":"2026-11-05T23:11:46.999Z","text":"A little unhinged, a little divine— like a disco ball dropped in the middle of a blackout.","likes":20,"restacks":3,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f96b23b9-cb1e-4a58-8bdb-b76a315b6a17_309x306.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379903682"},{"id":379791182,"date":"2026-11-05T22:55:00.202Z","text":"✨💯","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379791182"},{"id":379569443,"date":"2026-11-05T20:33:01.137Z","text":"Make your workspace feel like the headquarters of a mysterious cosmic genius. \n\nhttps://magickmica.substack.com/p/main-character-energy-an-affirmation","likes":9,"restacks":0,"replies":3,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c45fd9a0-53ec-4e22-8f82-a678726fc206_1536x1024.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379569443"},{"id":379724065,"date":"2026-11-05T19:22:00.354Z","text":"The eyes are the stars of this transmission. Imagine wandering into a forest where the trees have been watching the universe for a thousand years. ✨","likes":10,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/eeb2e0fb-4fb1-441e-b5b3-4e3e834d5615_378x250.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379724065"},{"id":378718395,"date":"2026-11-05T16:33:42.627Z","text":"Imagination is the cosmic ink with which possibility writes itself into reality.","likes":18,"restacks":2,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d2031459-e033-49be-b078-130ab0a88ae6_1402x1122.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378718395"},{"id":379254897,"date":"2026-11-05T08:58:48.732Z","text":"Walk softly. You are crossing a place where the visible and invisible dream together.","likes":15,"restacks":4,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379254897"},{"id":379047895,"date":"2026-11-05T01:06:34.124Z","text":"https://magickmica.github.io/turn-down-the-static.html","likes":4,"restacks":0,"replies":2,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e21b3bf1-1ed1-4a14-974c-b4631c55315c_1951x1201.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":"https://magickmica.github.io/turn-down-the-static.html","url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-379047895"},{"id":378607168,"date":"2026-11-04T16:01:39.700Z","text":"❤️🧡💛▀▄▀▄▀▄💚💙💜","likes":16,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1a1afcfc-738e-4250-88c9-3f0c12d2b756_500x671.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378607168"},{"id":378468747,"date":"2026-11-04T13:36:10.258Z","text":"We decorate ourselves because humans have always been storytellers—and sometimes the story begins before we say a word.","likes":5,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378468747"},{"id":378452556,"date":"2026-11-04T13:16:50.734Z","text":"Become a sanctuary of clear seeing, a garden of brave questions, and an oasis for your own becoming.","likes":10,"restacks":2,"replies":0,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aabc7018-9962-4d3e-a08a-cde2e3de90bc_2172x724.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378452556"},{"id":378397217,"date":"2026-11-04T13:00:01.215Z","text":"I welcome wonder, curiosity, and unexpected possibilities.","likes":6,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378397217"},{"id":378432714,"date":"2026-11-04T12:52:08.339Z","text":"The strongest magic is knowing what deserves your energy and what no longer belongs in your orbit.","likes":12,"restacks":3,"replies":1,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378432714"},{"id":378402000,"date":"2026-11-04T12:09:08.219Z","text":"Remember who you are beneath the noise: a living question wrapped in stardust, learning how to shine.","likes":12,"restacks":3,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378402000"},{"id":378385899,"date":"2026-11-04T11:43:43.248Z","text":"The inner world is a universe of its own. Explore it with the courage of a cosmic traveler.","likes":11,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3c1de88e-2f16-4790-9e70-0b6038deaddc_500x500.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378385899"},{"id":378383352,"date":"2026-11-04T11:39:44.138Z","text":"⭐ YOUR INNER ORACLE IS ALWAYS ON. MAYBE TURN DOWN THE STATIC.","likes":9,"restacks":0,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378383352"},{"id":378380690,"date":"2026-11-04T11:35:18.870Z","text":"What you call reality may be only one frequency of a much larger song.","likes":12,"restacks":0,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/acf4333d-277f-4bdd-9091-c238e9577148_600x338.gif","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378380690"},{"id":378054380,"date":"2026-11-04T00:51:44.672Z","text":"✨","likes":15,"restacks":5,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/471f3452-1c66-42ad-ac99-f40e73e7c94e_2736x1536.jpeg","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378054380"},{"id":378027915,"date":"2026-11-04T00:04:17.470Z","text":"","likes":4,"restacks":1,"replies":0,"image":null,"video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-378027915"},{"id":377124586,"date":"2026-11-04T00:00:28.019Z","text":"✨","likes":7,"restacks":1,"replies":1,"image":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9fe88ab6-f1fb-4c56-9c99-ea369ab762a8_1672x941.png","video_still":null,"video":null,"link":null,"url":"https://substack.com/@magickmica/note/c-377124586"}]}